sections.text:
One of the best overall DPS performances in the game within her best team, given the right amount of investment. Arguably the strongest WhiWa DPS and an insane ToA/Matrix DPS too;

 Can buff the team’s Aero and Echo skill damage, providing extra synergies;

 Has built-in Stun mechanics that teammates can exploit via her Outro, making full team rotations easier. Can also group and stun enemies in her own rotation to handle different battle situations.
